          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khuluma ku-Aroni uthi: Yilowo lalowo owenzalo yakho ezizukulwaneni zabo olesici makangasondeli ukuze anikele isinkwa sikaNkulunkulu wakhe.",
          "type": "text",
